msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Алдаанууд"

msgid "Ebarimt Pos API sdk errors."
msgstr ""

msgid "Base error for the SDK."
msgstr ""

msgid "Network / timeout / DNS / TLS errors."
msgstr ""

msgid "``request_sent`` says whether the request could have reached the server:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"``False``: the failure happened before any byte of the request left the client (connection "
"refused, DNS failure, unreachable host, connect timeout, proxy refused the tunnel, or the OAuth "
"token fetch that precedes the request failed). The server cannot have acted on it, so resending "
"is safe even for non-idempotent methods such as ``receipt.create``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"``True``: the request may have been received (read/write timeout, dropped connection, protocol "
"error, ...) or the SDK cannot tell. A ``POST`` may already have been persisted, so resending it "
"can duplicate the write. Unknown failures always report ``True``."
msgstr ""

msgid "``cause`` holds the underlying exception (usually an ``httpx`` error)."
msgstr ""

msgid "The client is missing configuration a call needs; nothing was sent."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Raised before any request goes out (for example, ``merchant_registration`` called without "
"credentials), so ``request_sent`` is always ``False``. The message names every missing field."
msgstr ""

msgid "Response body was not valid JSON when JSON was expected."
msgstr ""

msgid "Pydantic validation errors (request or response)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Return Pydantic-style validation errors."
msgstr ""

msgid "Non-2xx response from server."
msgstr ""

